---

Note on the artwork: the pet images shipped in `lib/assets/skins/` (the sources
are `assets/skins/<id>.png`, eight 420x409 PNGs) are NOT original drawings of this
project. All eight are derived from ONE drawing — the eight differ only in colour,
produced by per-region hue/saturation/value changes on the coloured areas and a
multiplicative tint on the pale ones.
It carries an "OleapCrow" artist mark and was supplied by the repository owner.
Licence situation: supplied by the repository owner; see LICENSE (this file).

That image is not a DeepSeek asset and is not official DeepSeek branding. Apart
from it, this package contains no third-party video, font or audio assets, and it
fetches nothing from a third-party host at runtime: the image, the client bundle
and every request stay on the DSH server this plugin is installed into.
